title: The Unified Socialist Youth
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: jsu_formed == 1 and jsu_timer = 0
on-arrival: jsu_timer = 7; month_actions += 1; js_militarization_cost = 2 if js_militancy > 0.1 else js_militarization_cost = 1; js_militarization_cost = 3 if js_militancy > 0.25
card-image: img/jsu.jpg
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs, antifascism

= The Iron Front

The Unified Socialist Youth (Juventudes Socialistas Unificadas) is our new antifascist coordination front, consisting of the PSOE and the PCE's youths organization. How should we use the Unified Socialist Youth?

[? if workers_psoe < 45 or workers_psoe < workers_ap or workers_psoe < workers_prr : Unfortunately, the Unified Socialist Youth's effectiveness is dragged down by the PSOE's unpopularity, as the PSOE is no longer the dominant party among the workers. Many JSU members have left, and many workers are not interested. ?]

- @defense: Rally for defense against the fascists.
- @republic: Rally to save the democratic republic against dictatorship.
- @wtb: Rally for economic change and the Agrarian Reform.
- @revolution: Rally for the socialist revolution and against the bourgeoisie.
- @easy_discard

@defense
subtitle: -[+ js_militarization_cost +] resources
choose-if: resources >= js_militarization_cost
on-arrival: resources -= js_militarization_cost; js_strength += 50; js_militancy += 0.05; prr_relation -= 5

The JSU rallies for the militant defense of the republic against the reactionary paramilitaries, strengthening the Juventudes Socialistas.

@republic
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); democratization += 1; workers_psoe += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; unemployed_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; middle_psoe += 6*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4

The JSU rallies in defense of the democratic republic.

@wtb
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it.
view-if: wtb_adopted == 1
on-arrival: workers_psoe += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_psoe += 6*(1-dissent); rural_psoe += 8*(1-dissent);

The Agrarian Reform is the rallying point for the entire PSOE and its affiliated organizations, including the JSU.

@revolution
on-arrival: pro_republic -= 6*(1-dissent); democratization -= 1; workers_psoe += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization <= 1; unemployed_psoe += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization <= 4; middle_psoe -= 6; rural_psoe += 5*(1-dissent); ar_relation -= 10; prr_relation -=10; prrs_relation -=10; dlr_relation -=10; other_left_republicans_relation -=10; other_right_republicans_relation -=10; regionalists_relation -=10

The JSU rallies against the democratic republic and for the workers and peasants' revolution. 
